OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire-hit residents remove
OL,4,AGreenpeace mural of Burnham from
OL,5,Ascorched mountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents affected by wildfires say
OL,8,Fthey were left "angry and upset" after
OL,9,Fa mural of Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,10,Fwas painted on a blackened mountainside
OL,11,Fabove their homes.
OL,13,FDubbing it an "intrusion into grief"
OL,14,Ftwo walkers removed Greenpeace's work
OL,15,Fwith rakes.
OL,17,FThe campaign group's 1,120-sq-m
OL,18,Fanti-oil and drilling image showed
OL,19,FBurnham holding an oil drum and the
OL,20,Fwords: "Our house is on fire Andy."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
