OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire-hit residents remove
OL,4,AGreenpeace mural of Burnham from
OL,5,Ascorched mountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreenpeace said the work, in Capelulo,
OL,8,FConwy, had not been meant to upset
OL,9,Fpeople but to "draw attention to the
OL,10,Fescalating climate crisis".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
